<linker>
  <!--
    Managed stripping is set to High, and VContainer builds every registered type
    through reflection (Runtime/Internal/ReflectionInjector.cs). Nothing in our
    source constructs those types directly, so IL2CPP cannot prove the
    constructors are reachable and strips them - which never reproduces in the
    editor, only on device.

    VContainer's source generator would emit injectors IL2CPP can trace and make
    this file unnecessary, but it is not part of the git-URL distribution.

    UniTask and DOTween are absent on purpose: UniTask uses no reflection, and
    DOTween marks its own entry points with [Preserve].
  -->
  <assembly fullname="VContainer" preserve="all" />
  <assembly fullname="TurretRush.Game" preserve="all" />
</linker>
